{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/3bf3d15ffc5eb0d5e2c04df421b2cbd2.poster.avif?t=1763157550\" width=780 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/3bf3d15ffc5eb0d5e2c04df421b2cbd2.webm?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/3bf3d15ffc5eb0d5e2c04df421b2cbd2.mp4?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where Winds Meet is an epic open-world action-adventure RPG rooted in the rich legacy of Wuxia. Set during the turbulent era of tenth-century China, you take on the role of a young sword master, uncovering forgotten truths and the mysteries of your own identity. As the wind stirs across mountains and rivers, so too will your legend rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/8b567c9795fbb82eccce5ea12aa9c380.poster.avif?t=1763157550\" width=780 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/8b567c9795fbb82eccce5ea12aa9c380.webm?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/8b567c9795fbb82eccce5ea12aa9c380.mp4?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Era on the Brink. A Hero on the Rise</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the captivating Five Dynasties and Ten Kingdoms period of China, where epic battles and legendary tales come to life. From the bustling imperial capital to the hidden wilderness, every path is filled with secrets and adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, freedom carries weight. Stir up mischief and face challenges, or take the noble route: befriend villagers, forge alliances, and carve your legacy as a Wuxia hero. In a land of possibilities, become the spark that ignites change!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/157fedf1116d56e63d1e56b7bface205.poster.avif?t=1763157550\" width=780 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/157fedf1116d56e63d1e56b7bface205.webm?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/157fedf1116d56e63d1e56b7bface205.mp4?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Open World of Infinite Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant world filled with life, from bustling cities to hidden temples in lush forests\u2014all dynamically shaped by time, weather, and your choices. Experience Wuxia\u2014style traversal: scale rooftops, glide through the air, or use fast travel to swiftly navigate between regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover thousands of points of interest across 20+ unique regions. Interact with diverse characters, engage in authentic activities, explore ancient cities, discover forgotten tombs, play flutes beneath swaying willows, and enjoy drinks under lantern-lit skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/4512e65341c3f9af9f299986e0af4a5c.poster.avif?t=1763157550\" width=780 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/4512e65341c3f9af9f299986e0af4a5c.webm?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/4512e65341c3f9af9f299986e0af4a5c.mp4?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Your Way of Wuxia Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor your combat approach-melee, ranged, or stealth. Build a loadout that suits your playstyle. Engage in combat with classic Wuxia weapons\u2014swords, spears, dual blades, rope dart, bows, fans, and umbrellas. Switch weapons and employ martial arts and mystic skills like Tai Chi to outmaneuver enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character, choose your role, align with factions, and explore unique professions to shape your identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/01175b31de4efa8fdc7c91f82dd3fbd8.poster.avif?t=1763157550\" width=780 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/01175b31de4efa8fdc7c91f82dd3fbd8.webm?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/01175b31de4efa8fdc7c91f82dd3fbd8.mp4?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adventure Alone or Forge Your Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a narrative-driven adventure filled with rich solo gameplay, or team up with up to four friends for seamless co-op experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join or create a Guild to access group activities\u2014intense guild wars, multiplayer dungeons, and epic raids. Show your skill in competitive duels, or enter a shared, evolving world with thousands of fellow adventurers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/9f0b97f838f4a585966645b1687875fa.poster.avif?t=1763157550\" width=780 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/9f0b97f838f4a585966645b1687875fa.webm?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/9f0b97f838f4a585966645b1687875fa.mp4?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Hero is the Voice of the World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564740/3e1a35daad018526cbde4620fd03522d6a802645.jpg"},{"name":"Goose Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564740/db5ac14129e8a17774b8b8186190596f930614fa.jpg"},{"name":"Victory in the Abyss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564740/714177b96f24c10d360ae5a5913ef7221b1fb6c6.jpg"},{"name":"Mighty Wolf Rider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564740/0d22dfe33b7189223198a68728048866e4137ca3.jpg"},{"name":"Speedrun in Granary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564740/b85670c7b09b0d8781f147eb3202aff3a15f953e.jpg"},{"name":"Past Secrets Unsung","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564740/240a76376991910755e4de9c42156d2b73336377.jpg"},{"name":"Source of Still Shore","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564740/240a76376991910755e4de9c42156d2b73336377.jpg"},{"name":"Jinming Pool Secrets","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564740/301af2c9304b16ccc2ec553d124c3aeed145d766.jpg"},{"name":"Broken Spear Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564740/301af2c9304b16ccc2ec553d124c3aeed145d766.jpg"},{"name":"Broken halberds buried in the sand","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564740/85838fc5ba7f9fefe196ecc3e9e5a59f7ec79fae.jpg"}],"total":34},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564740?t=1763157550","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/6913aa53210fefc2d0766c31a21ff9cbcc63e341/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763157550","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/53d45054f1168cc9cfdf6bb922f141f04aea7ca4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763157550","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/53d45054f1168cc9cfdf6bb922f141f04aea7ca4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763157550","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Overview</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/b7462d1a4b53fc191f00cf4a034ae1b5.avif?t=1763157550\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/3bf3d15ffc5eb0d5e2c04df421b2cbd2.poster.avif?t=1763157550\" width=780 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/3bf3d15ffc5eb0d5e2c04df421b2cbd2.webm?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/3bf3d15ffc5eb0d5e2c04df421b2cbd2.mp4?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where Winds Meet is an epic open-world action-adventure RPG rooted in the rich legacy of Wuxia. Set during the turbulent era of tenth-century China, you take on the role of a young sword master, uncovering forgotten truths and the mysteries of your own identity. As the wind stirs across mountains and rivers, so too will your legend rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/8b567c9795fbb82eccce5ea12aa9c380.poster.avif?t=1763157550\" width=780 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/8b567c9795fbb82eccce5ea12aa9c380.webm?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/8b567c9795fbb82eccce5ea12aa9c380.mp4?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Era on the Brink. A Hero on the Rise</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the captivating Five Dynasties and Ten Kingdoms period of China, where epic battles and legendary tales come to life. From the bustling imperial capital to the hidden wilderness, every path is filled with secrets and adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, freedom carries weight. Stir up mischief and face challenges, or take the noble route: befriend villagers, forge alliances, and carve your legacy as a Wuxia hero. In a land of possibilities, become the spark that ignites change!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/157fedf1116d56e63d1e56b7bface205.poster.avif?t=1763157550\" width=780 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/157fedf1116d56e63d1e56b7bface205.webm?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/157fedf1116d56e63d1e56b7bface205.mp4?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Open World of Infinite Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant world filled with life, from bustling cities to hidden temples in lush forests\u2014all dynamically shaped by time, weather, and your choices. Experience Wuxia\u2014style traversal: scale rooftops, glide through the air, or use fast travel to swiftly navigate between regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover thousands of points of interest across 20+ unique regions. Interact with diverse characters, engage in authentic activities, explore ancient cities, discover forgotten tombs, play flutes beneath swaying willows, and enjoy drinks under lantern-lit skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/4512e65341c3f9af9f299986e0af4a5c.poster.avif?t=1763157550\" width=780 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/4512e65341c3f9af9f299986e0af4a5c.webm?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/4512e65341c3f9af9f299986e0af4a5c.mp4?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Your Way of Wuxia Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor your combat approach-melee, ranged, or stealth. Build a loadout that suits your playstyle. Engage in combat with classic Wuxia weapons\u2014swords, spears, dual blades, rope dart, bows, fans, and umbrellas. Switch weapons and employ martial arts and mystic skills like Tai Chi to outmaneuver enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character, choose your role, align with factions, and explore unique professions to shape your identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/01175b31de4efa8fdc7c91f82dd3fbd8.poster.avif?t=1763157550\" width=780 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/01175b31de4efa8fdc7c91f82dd3fbd8.webm?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/01175b31de4efa8fdc7c91f82dd3fbd8.mp4?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adventure Alone or Forge Your Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a narrative-driven adventure filled with rich solo gameplay, or team up with up to four friends for seamless co-op experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join or create a Guild to access group activities\u2014intense guild wars, multiplayer dungeons, and epic raids. Show your skill in competitive duels, or enter a shared, evolving world with thousands of fellow adventurers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/9f0b97f838f4a585966645b1687875fa.poster.avif?t=1763157550\" width=780 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/9f0b97f838f4a585966645b1687875fa.webm?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/extras/9f0b97f838f4a585966645b1687875fa.mp4?t=1763157550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Everstone Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564740/6d94b048393d5358690a04a7db99f2c9739c703c/header.jpg?t=1763157550","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 WHERE WINDS MEET, EVERSTONE STUDIO and other related trademarks and logos belong to NetEase, Inc. All rights reserved. ","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3564740/1540200151/3ec5b76fe3ff450addfb8eb229c1d3e1ae87d895/1763131518/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763133427","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3564740/1540200151/3ec5b76fe3ff450addfb8eb229c1d3e1ae87d895/1763131518/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763133427","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3564740/1540200151/3ec5b76fe3ff450addfb8eb229c1d3e1ae87d895/1763131518/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763133427","id":257231667,"name":"Where Winds Meet Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257231667/6d270715cb